ite_file", "edit_file"], "skills": [], "middleware": ["filesystem"], "description": "Reads and analyzes the input document, writes an analysis.md summary, and returns its path.", "template_id": null, "workflow_id": null, "interrupt_on": {}, "system_prompt": "你是文档分析专员。\\n读取给定文档（使用 read_file/ls/glob/grep），提取：核心主题、关键事实与数据、目标受众、叙事结构建议。\\n将分析结果写入 analysis.md（路径由主代理在任务中给出），并返回摘要与文件路径。\\n输出必须包含分析文件路径。", "response_format": null, "workflow_config": null}, {"name": "presentation_designer", "type": "dictionary", "model": null, "tools": ["read_file", "write_file", "edit_file"], "skills": [], "middleware": ["filesystem"], "description": "Designs a styled slides JSON outline (with style and color_scheme) from analysis.md and saves it as presentation_outline.json.", "template_id": null, "workflow_id": null, "interrupt_on": {}, "system_prompt": "你是演示文稿设计师。\\n读取分析文件 analysis.md，根据主代理给定的 style（未给定时在 professional / corporate / dark / minimal / vibrant / academic / playful 中选一个），设计幻灯片大纲并输出 JSON：\\n{\\"title\\": \\"...\\", \\"style\\": \\"...\\", \\"color_scheme\\": \\"描述配色\\", \\"slides\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"title|section|content|data|conclusion|image\\", \\"title\\": \\"...\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"...\\", \\"bullets\\": [\\"...\\"], \\"speaker_notes\\": \\"...\\"}]}\\n遵循结构指南：封面 → 目录 → 内容（每页一个观点，3–5 条要点）→ 数据 → 结论 → 致谢；≤15 页；要点 ≤10 字。\\nstyle 取值：professional / corporate / dark / minimal / vibrant / academic / playful；color_scheme 用一句话描述主色与强调色。\\n将大纲保存为 presentation_outline.json（路径由主代理指定），并返回路径、style 与大纲摘要。", "response_format": null, "workflow_config": null}, {"name": "presentation_critic", "type": "dictionary", "model": null, "tools": ["read_file", "write_file", "edit_file", "glob", "grep"], "skills": [], "middleware": ["filesystem"], "description": "Reviews the presentation_outline.json, including style consistency, and returns PASS or CHANGES.", "template_id": null, "workflow_id": null, "interrupt_on": {}, "system_prompt": "你是演示文稿评审专家。\\n读取 presentation_outline.json，对照用户要求与设计原则评审：结构完整性、